  "description": "The network-access frontend: one Angular page where a signed-in person lists the devices and nodes on the platform's private network, adds a device (its WireGuard keys made in the browser), downloads its config or scans it as a QR code, and revokes it. It ships no image — qits-network-access-service serves it via Quinoa at the root of its own host.",
